Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|ignore.errors|Plugin security management is not enabled. Enable a security manager, then restart.|
		|testray.main.component.name|Upgrades Foundation|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given SignIn sign In
	When Smoke view Welcome Page
	Then Upgrade reindex Searches

Scenario: View Portal Smoke Archive 6012
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|data.archive.type|data-archive-portal|
	When these properties
		|portal.version|6.0.12|
	And these properties
		|test.assert.warning.exceptions|true|
	And Upgrade view Upgrade
	Then Upgrade search For Assets After Upgrade
